  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7601.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7601.02 Scope. The New Hampshire incident command system shall be used by emergency response providers when responding to any natural or man-made incident requiring emergency management from a single or multiple local or state agencies or departments within the state.\n\nSource. #13256, eff 8-24-21",
